@startuml a-seq-failover
title Вариант 1. Failover: push не подтверждён → SMS (провайдер A отказал → B), позднее подтверждение push
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

participant "Push Sender" as PS
participant "APNs / FCM" as APNS
actor "Приложение" as APP
participant "Timer Worker" as TW
database "Delivery DB" as DB
participant "Outbox Relay" as OR
queue "Kafka" as K
participant "Delivery\nOrchestrator" as O
participant "SMS Sender" as SS
database "Redis" as R
participant "SMS-провайдер A" as SA
participant "SMS-провайдер B" as SB
participant "Receipt\nCollector" as RC

== t = 0: попытка #1 (push) передана провайдеру, deadline = t + 10 с ==
PS -> APNS : send(collapse-id = notification_id)
APNS --> PS : 200 OK
PS -> K : AttemptSubmitted(#1)
note over APP : устройство вне сети\nили приложение выгружено ОС

... 10 с без подтверждения ...

== t ≈ 10 с: таймаут push ==
TW -> DB : BEGIN\nSELECT … FROM delivery_attempt\n  WHERE state IN (QUEUED, SUBMITTED) AND deadline_at <= now()\n  ORDER BY deadline_at LIMIT 500 FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED\nUPDATE attempt #1 SET state = TIMED_OUT\nUPDATE notification SET step = 2, version = v + 1\n  WHERE id = … AND version = v AND state = DISPATCHING\nINSERT attempt #2 sms (QUEUED, deadline = now + 60 с)\nINSERT outbox (SendSms, StatusChanged)\nCOMMIT
note right of TW
  Тот же код автомата, что в оркестраторе.
  CAS по version: если ack уже обработан,
  UPDATE вернёт 0 строк → ROLLBACK,
  SMS не создаётся.
end note
OR -> K : ntf.cmd.sms.tx
K -> SS : SendSms(attempt #2, not_after)
SS -> R : GET cancel:{attempt #2}
R --> SS : нет флага

== Отказ провайдера A внутри канала SMS ==
SS -> SA : send(client_ref = attempt #2)
SA --> SS : таймаут 2 с
SS -> SA : GET status(client_ref)
SA --> SS : 503
SS -> SS : circuit breaker A → OPEN;\nntf_sms_ambiguous_total{provider=A} += 1
note right of SS
  Неоднозначный отказ: статус неизвестен.
  ASR-1 важнее ASR-3: отправляем через B,
  возможный дубль учитывается метрикой.
end note
SS -> SB : send(client_ref = attempt #2)
SB --> SS : 202 Accepted (provider_message_id)
SS -> K : AttemptSubmitted(#2, provider = B)
K -> O : AttemptSubmitted(#2)
O -> DB : UPDATE attempt #2 SET state = SUBMITTED\nWHERE state = QUEUED

== Доставка по SMS ==
SB -> RC : DLR DELIVERED (client_ref = attempt #2)
RC -> K : ReceiptReceived(#2, DELIVERED)
K -> O : ReceiptReceived(#2)
O -> DB : BEGIN\nnotification → DELIVERED (sms) [CAS по version]\nattempt #2 → DELIVERED\nINSERT outbox (StatusChanged)\nCOMMIT

== t ≈ 14 с: позднее подтверждение push ==
APP -> RC : POST /v1/acks {attempt #1}
RC -> K : ReceiptReceived(#1, DELIVERED)
K -> O : ReceiptReceived(#1)
O -> DB : UPDATE attempt #1 SET late_delivered_at = now()\n(уведомление уже DELIVERED: новых команд нет)
O -> O : ntf_late_ack_total{channel=push} += 1

== Альтернатива: ack по push пришёл до отправки SMS ==
alt SendSms ещё в очереди Kafka
  O -> DB : notification → DELIVERED (push) [CAS];\nattempt #2 → CANCELLED
  O -> R : SET cancel:{attempt #2} EX 3600
  SS -> R : GET cancel:{attempt #2}
  R --> SS : CANCELLED
  SS -> SS : SMS не отправляется
end
@enduml
